<doxygen xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="compound.xsd" version="1.18.0" xml:lang="en-US">
  <compounddef id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin" kind="page">
    <compoundname>Decl_NetCDF_plugin</compoundname>
    <title>The Decl&apos;NetCDF plugin</title>
    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><anchor id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1md_plugins_2decl__netcdf_2README"/></para>
<para>The Decl&apos;NetCDF plugin was created to read from and write to NetCDF files in a declarative way.</para>
<para>Decl&apos;NetCDF plugin allows you to:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Read/write data as NetCDF variables from/to NetCDF file.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Define groups in the NetCDF file. Groups can be nested.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Read/write variables and groups attributes. <bold>Automatically read and written when openning the file.</bold></para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Execute input/output operations on event.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Execute input/output operations on data share (when the event is not defined).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Define <computeroutput>UNLIMITED</computeroutput> dimension and dimensions names.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Read/write only part of NetCDF variable by hyperslab definition.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Read/write in parallel mode using MPI.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_configuration">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf</computeroutput></title><para>A <emphasis>file description</emphasis>, a mapping with the keys below that specifies the I/O to execute in one file, or a sequence of file descriptions. Keys not listed here are ignored.</para>
<sect2 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1example-of-pluginsdecl_netcdf">
<title>Example of <computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf</computeroutput></title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>decl_netcdf:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>file:<sp/>&quot;file_name.nc&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>write:<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>file:<sp/>&quot;file_name_2.nc&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>write:<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>file:<sp/>&quot;file_name.nc&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>read:<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_file">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.file</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Required.</emphasis> A <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref>, the name (path) of the input/output file.</para>
<sect2 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1example-of-pluginsdecl_netcdffile">
<title>Example of <computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.file</computeroutput></title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>decl_netcdf:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>file:<sp/>&quot;file_name_${i}.nc&quot;</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_comm">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.communicator</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref> referencing a valid MPI communicator, which enables parallel NetCDF input/output. All processes must have the same communicator and filename.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="warning"><para>Feature not tested yet</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
<sect2 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1example-of-pluginsdecl_netcdfcommunicator">
<title>Example of <computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.communicator</computeroutput></title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>decl_netcdf:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>file:<sp/>&quot;file_name.nc&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>communicator:<sp/>$MPI_COMM_WORLD</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_on_event">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.on_event</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A scalar, or a sequence of scalars, the events on which the plugin reads/writes data from/to the file. If not specified, each data is read or written when it is shared.</para>
<sect2 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1example-of-pluginsdecl_netcdfon_event">
<title>Example of <computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.on_event</computeroutput></title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>decl_netcdf:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>file:<sp/>&quot;file_name.nc&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>on_event:<sp/>[&quot;event_1&quot;,<sp/>&quot;event_2&quot;]</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_when">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.when</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref>, the condition on which the plugin executes input/output operations on the file, always true by default.</para>
<sect2 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1example-of-pluginsdecl_netcdfwhen">
<title>Example of <computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.when</computeroutput></title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>decl_netcdf:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>file:<sp/>&quot;file_name.nc&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>when:<sp/>&quot;$i<sp/>&lt;<sp/>10&quot;</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_deflate">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.deflate</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> An integer-valued <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref>, the compression level (0-9) for all variables of the file (default=0). It can be overridden for each variable, see <ref refid="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_variables_deflate" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.variables.&lt;variable_path&gt;.deflate</computeroutput></ref>.</para>
<sect2 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1example-of-pluginsdecl_netcdfdeflate">
<title>Example of <computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.deflate</computeroutput></title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>decl_netcdf:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>file:<sp/>&quot;compressed_file.nc&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>deflate:<sp/>6</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_groups">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.groups</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A mapping, the groups of the file, mainly used to read/write attributes values of the groups.</para>
<para>If a group has no attributes, it can be omitted: Decl&apos;NetCDF creates the groups of every variable by default.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_groups_name">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.groups.&lt;group_path&gt;</computeroutput></title><para>A mapping, the group of path <computeroutput>&lt;group_path&gt;</computeroutput>, with <computeroutput>/</computeroutput> separating nested groups (<computeroutput>group1/group2</computeroutput>).</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_groups_attributes">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.groups.&lt;group_path&gt;.attributes</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A mapping, the attributes of the group.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_attr">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.groups.&lt;group_path&gt;.attributes.&lt;attribute_name&gt;</computeroutput></title><para>A <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref>, the value written as the attribute named <computeroutput>&lt;attribute_name&gt;</computeroutput>, or referencing the data where to store it on read. Attributes are read and written when the file is opened.</para>
<sect2 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1example-of-pluginsdecl_netcdfgroupsgroup_pathattributesattribute_name">
<title>Example of <computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.groups.&lt;group_path&gt;.attributes.&lt;attribute_name&gt;</computeroutput></title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>decl_netcdf:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>file:<sp/>&quot;file_name.nc&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>groups:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>group1:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>attributes:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>attr1:<sp/>$value1</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>attr2:<sp/>$value2</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>group1/group2:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>attributes:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>attr1:<sp/>$value3</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>attr2:<sp/>$value4</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_variables">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.variables</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A mapping, the variables of the file, mainly used to define dimensions names and read/write attributes of the variables.</para>
<para>A variable that is not defined here is given the name of the descriptor, the same type and no attributes, and the plugin gives arbitrary names to its dimensions.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_variables_value">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.variables.&lt;variable_path&gt;</computeroutput></title><para>A mapping, the variable of path <computeroutput>&lt;variable_path&gt;</computeroutput>. A variable in a group has its path prefixed by that of its group: <computeroutput>group_name/variable_name</computeroutput>.</para>
<sect2 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1example-of-pluginsdecl_netcdfvariablesvariable_path">
<title>Example of <computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.variables.&lt;variable_path&gt;</computeroutput></title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>decl_netcdf:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>file:<sp/>&quot;file_name.nc&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>variables:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>group1/group2/variable_name:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subtype:<sp/>double</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>size:<sp/>[0,<sp/>$value,<sp/>$value]<sp/>#<sp/>0<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>UNLIMITED<sp/>dimension</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dimensions:<sp/>[&quot;time&quot;,<sp/>&quot;height&quot;,<sp/>&quot;width&quot;]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>deflate:<sp/>6</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>chunking:<sp/>[10,<sp/>100,<sp/>100]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>attributes:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>attr1:<sp/>$value</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_variables_type">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.variables.&lt;variable_path&gt;.type</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> The <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_datatype_type" kindref="member"><computeroutput>&lt;datatype&gt;.type</computeroutput></ref> of the variable, whose other keys (<computeroutput>subtype</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>size</computeroutput>...) are given beside it, in <ref refid="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_variables_value" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.variables.&lt;variable_path&gt;</computeroutput></ref>. It is mandatory if the type of the variable differs from that of the descriptor. It also allows to define an <computeroutput>UNLIMITED</computeroutput> dimension, whose size must then be set to <computeroutput>0</computeroutput>.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_variables_dimensions">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.variables.&lt;variable_path&gt;.dimensions</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A sequence of scalars, the names of the dimensions of the variable. A value that is not a sequence is ignored.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_variables_attributes">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.variables.&lt;variable_path&gt;.attributes</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A mapping, the attributes of the variable.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_variables_attributes_attribute_name">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.variables.&lt;variable_path&gt;.attributes.&lt;attribute_name&gt;</computeroutput></title><para>A <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref>, the value written as the attribute named <computeroutput>&lt;attribute_name&gt;</computeroutput>, or referencing the data where to store it on read, as for <ref refid="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_attr" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.groups.&lt;group_path&gt;.attributes.&lt;attribute_name&gt;</computeroutput></ref>.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_variables_deflate">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.variables.&lt;variable_path&gt;.deflate</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> An integer-valued <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref>, the compression level (0-9) of the variable, using the native NetCDF compression. It defaults to <ref refid="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_deflate" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.deflate</computeroutput></ref>, and <computeroutput>0</computeroutput> means no compression.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_variables_chunking">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.variables.&lt;variable_path&gt;.chunking</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> An integer-valued <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref> or a sequence of them, the chunk size of the variable for chunked storage, used when compression is enabled. It must have the same dimension as the variable. If not specified, an automatic chunking is used.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_write">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.write</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> The writes to execute, either:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>a scalar or a sequence of scalars, see <ref refid="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_write_seq" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.write[*]</computeroutput></ref>,</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>a mapping, see <ref refid="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_write_data_name" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.write.&lt;data_name&gt;</computeroutput></ref>.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_write_seq">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.write[*]</computeroutput></title><para>A scalar, the name of a descriptor to write to the file. The NetCDF variable has the name of the descriptor, unless defined in <ref refid="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_variables" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.variables</computeroutput></ref>.</para>
<sect2 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1example-of-pluginsdecl_netcdfwrite">
<title>Example of <computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.write[*]</computeroutput></title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>decl_netcdf:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>file:<sp/>&quot;file_name.nc&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>write:<sp/>[data_name_1,<sp/>data_name_2]</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_write_data_name">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.write.&lt;data_name&gt;</computeroutput></title><para>A mapping, the write of the descriptor named <computeroutput>&lt;data_name&gt;</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="warning"><para>To write a record datatype, the <computeroutput>+decl_netcdf.type</computeroutput> type attribute must be defined with compound type name.</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
<sect2 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1example-of-pluginsdecl_netcdfwritedata_name">
<title>Example of <computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.write.&lt;data_name&gt;</computeroutput></title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">data:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>int_submatrix_11:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subtype:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>size:<sp/>[4,<sp/>4]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>decl_netcdf:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>file:<sp/>&quot;file_name.nc&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>variables:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>integer_matrix:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subtype:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>size:<sp/>[8,<sp/>8]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dimensions:<sp/>[&quot;height&quot;,<sp/>&quot;width&quot;]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>write:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>int_submatrix_11:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>when:<sp/>$i<sp/>&lt;<sp/>10</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>variable:<sp/>integer_matrix</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>variable_selection:<sp/><sp/>#<sp/>select<sp/>bottom-left<sp/>submatrix<sp/>4x4</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>start:<sp/>[4,<sp/>4]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subsize:<sp/>[4,<sp/>4]</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Record write configuration example: <programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">data:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>particle:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>struct</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>+decl_netcdf.type:<sp/>particle_xyz</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>members:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>x:<sp/>double</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>y:<sp/>double</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>z:<sp/>double</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>decl_netcdf:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>file:<sp/>&quot;file_name.nc&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>write:<sp/>[particle]</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_write_data_name_variable">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.write.&lt;data_name&gt;.variable</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref>, the path of the variable to write (that may be defined in <ref refid="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_variables" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.variables</computeroutput></ref>), the name of the descriptor by default.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_io_when">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.write.&lt;data_name&gt;.when</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref>, the condition on which the plugin writes this descriptor.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_var_selection">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.write.&lt;data_name&gt;.variable_selection</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A mapping, the part (hyperslab) of the NetCDF variable where to write the data.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_var_selection_start">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.write.&lt;data_name&gt;.variable_selection.start</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A sequence of integer-valued <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref>, the start index in each dimension.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_var_selection_subsize">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.write.&lt;data_name&gt;.variable_selection.subsize</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A sequence of integer-valued <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref>, the number of elements (count) in each dimension.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_read">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.read</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> The reads to execute, either:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>a scalar or a sequence of scalars, see <ref refid="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_read_seq" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.read[*]</computeroutput></ref>,</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>a mapping, see <ref refid="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_read_data_name" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.read.&lt;data_name&gt;</computeroutput></ref>.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_read_seq">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.read[*]</computeroutput></title><para>A scalar, the name of a descriptor to read from the file. The NetCDF variable must have the name of the descriptor and the same type, and no attributes are read.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_read_data_name">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.read.&lt;data_name&gt;</computeroutput></title><para>A mapping, the read into the descriptor named <computeroutput>&lt;data_name&gt;</computeroutput>.</para>
<sect2 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1example-of-pluginsdecl_netcdfreaddata_name">
<title>Example of <computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.read.&lt;data_name&gt;</computeroutput></title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">data:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>int_submatrix_11:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subtype:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>size:<sp/>[4,<sp/>4]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>matrix_size:<sp/>{type:<sp/>array,<sp/>subtype:<sp/>int,<sp/>size:<sp/>2}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>decl_netcdf:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>file:<sp/>&quot;file_name.nc&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>variables:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>integer_matrix:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subtype:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>size:<sp/>[8,<sp/>8]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>read:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>int_submatrix_11:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>when:<sp/>$i<sp/>&lt;<sp/>10</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>variable:<sp/>integer_matrix</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>variable_selection:<sp/><sp/>#<sp/>select<sp/>bottom-left<sp/>submatrix<sp/>4x4</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>start:<sp/>[4,<sp/>4]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subsize:<sp/>[4,<sp/>4]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>matrix_size:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>size_of:<sp/>integer_matrix<sp/><sp/>#<sp/>matrix_size<sp/>=<sp/>[8,8]</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_read_data_name_variable">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.read.&lt;data_name&gt;.variable</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref>, the path of the variable to read, as for <ref refid="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_write_data_name_variable" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.write.&lt;data_name&gt;.variable</computeroutput></ref>.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_read_data_name_size_of">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.read.&lt;data_name&gt;.size_of</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref>, the path of the variable whose size is read into the descriptor, in place of its content.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_read_data_name_when">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.read.&lt;data_name&gt;.when</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref>, the condition on which the plugin reads this descriptor.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_read_data_name_variable_selection">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.read.&lt;data_name&gt;.variable_selection</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A mapping, the part (hyperslab) of the NetCDF variable to read, with the same <computeroutput>start</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>subsize</computeroutput> keys as <ref refid="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_var_selection" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.write.&lt;data_name&gt;.variable_selection</computeroutput></ref>.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_plugins_decl_netcdf_logging">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.decl_netcdf.logging</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> The configuration of the logger of the plugin, see <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_plugins_plugin_name_logging" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.&lt;plugin_name&gt;.logging</computeroutput></ref>.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="Decl_NetCDF_plugin_1decl_netcdf_full_config">
<title>Full configuration example</title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">metadata:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>var_attr:<sp/>float</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>group1_attr:<sp/>float</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>group1_data_attr:<sp/>float</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">data:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>int_submatrix_top:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subtype:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>size:<sp/>[4,<sp/>8]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>int_submatrix_bottom:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subtype:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>size:<sp/>[4,<sp/>8]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>decl_netcdf:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>file:<sp/>&quot;example.nc&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>on_event:<sp/>&quot;write&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>groups:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>group_1:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>attributes:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>some_attr:<sp/>$group1_attr</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>group_1/data:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>attributes:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>some_attr:<sp/>$group1_data_attr</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>variables:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>group_1/data/int_matrix:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subtype:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>size:<sp/>[8,<sp/>8]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dimensions:<sp/>[&quot;height&quot;,<sp/>&quot;width&quot;]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>attributes:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>custom_attr:<sp/>$var_attr</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>write:<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>int_submatrix_top:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>variable:<sp/>group_1/data/int_matrix</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>variable_selection:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>start:<sp/>[0,<sp/>0]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subsize:<sp/>[4,<sp/>8]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>int_submatrix_bottom:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>variable:<sp/>group_1/data/int_matrix</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>variable_selection:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>start:<sp/>[4,<sp/>0]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subsize:<sp/>[4,<sp/>8]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>file:<sp/>&quot;example.nc&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>on_event:<sp/>&quot;read&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>groups:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>group_1/data:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>attributes:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>some_attr:<sp/>$custom_attr</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>variables:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>group_1/data/int_matrix:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subtype:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>size:<sp/>[8,<sp/>8]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dimensions:<sp/>[&quot;height&quot;,<sp/>&quot;width&quot;]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>attributes:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>custom_attr:<sp/>$var_attr</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>read:<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>int_submatrix_top:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>variable:<sp/>group_1/data/int_matrix</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>variable_selection:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>start:<sp/>[0,<sp/>0]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subsize:<sp/>[4,<sp/>8]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>int_submatrix_bottom:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>variable:<sp/>group_1/data/int_matrix</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>variable_selection:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>start:<sp/>[4,<sp/>0]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subsize:<sp/>[4,<sp/>8]</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</sect1>
